510
00:19:31,717 --> 00:19:33,386
- Yes.
- Please add that to the bill.

511
00:19:33,387 --> 00:19:34,757
Okay.

512
00:19:34,857 --> 00:19:37,117
With the order from the table next to you,

513
00:19:37,557 --> 00:19:39,086
it's 43.9 dollars in total.

514
00:19:39,087 --> 00:19:40,456
