535
00:20:21,298 --> 00:20:23,297
I'm hiding. Peekaboo!

536
00:20:23,437 --> 00:20:25,466
Could you move a little when I say peekaboo?

537
00:20:25,467 --> 00:20:26,707
Okay.

538
00:20:26,907 --> 00:20:28,776
I'm hiding.

539
00:20:28,777 --> 00:20:29,777
Peekaboo!

540
00:20:29,778 --> 00:20:30,806
(A faint smile slowly appears.)

541
00:20:30,807 --> 00:20:32,347
I think you moved a little too much.

542
00:20:32,777 --> 00:20:34,576
