- Yes?

548
00:20:42,917 --> 00:20:44,756
Excuse me. It's my first time serving.

549
00:20:44,757 --> 00:20:47,226
Eun Ji, do I put this on top of that?

550
00:20:47,227 --> 00:20:48,227
Yes, I'll help you.

551
00:20:48,597 --> 00:20:50,396
Please enjoy it.

552
00:20:50,397 --> 00:20:51,796
- Thank you.
- Sure.

553
00:20:51,797 --> 00:20:53,996
We made the rice cakes ourselves today.

554
00:20:53,997 --> 00:20:55,967
- You made them?
- Yes, from start to finish.

555
00:20:56,237 --> 00:20:58,307
Enjoy your food and stay healthy.

556
00:20:58,567 --> 00:20:59,937
Baby, don't cry anymore.

557
00:21:02,107 --> 00:21:07,007
