559
00:21:10,047 --> 00:21:12,017
(But it's not over yet.)

560
00:21:12,117 --> 00:21:13,286
(Overtime to-do list: Cleaning the dining area, washing dishes, )

561
00:21:13,287 --> 00:21:14,446
(refrigerating the leftover rice cakes, reviewing today's service, )

562
00:21:14,447 --> 00:21:15,563
(checking inventory, staff meal, prepping the sauce...)

563
00:21:15,587 --> 00:21:17,716
(And she has to be back at work bright and early tomorrow.)

564
00:21:17,717 --> 00:21:20,226
We'll take our last order at 4:44pm.

565
00:21:20,227 --> 00:21:21,327
- At 4:44pm?
- Yes.

566
00:21:21,727 --> 00:21:24,157
(Current Time: 4:37pm)

567
00:21:24,457 --> 00:21:26,396
