576
00:21:45,247 --> 00:21:47,146
I feel like I'm about to cry.

577
00:21:47,147 --> 00:21:49,816
I feel so sorry for her.

578
00:21:49,817 --> 00:21:51,386
They say when you really love someone, you start to feel...

579
00:21:51,387 --> 00:21:52,926
