580
00:21:52,927 --> 00:21:54,456
That's why I feel sorry for her sometimes.

581
00:21:54,457 --> 00:21:56,537
Not just sometimes. It happened ten times yesterday.

582
00:21:57,097 --> 00:21:58,266
