583
00:21:58,267 --> 00:21:59,767
See that? Do you feel the same way?

584
00:22:01,197 --> 00:22:02,296
We're sisters after all.

585
00:22:02,297 --> 00:22:04,036
Our Jade Emperor Tteokbokki is...

586
00:22:04,037 --> 00:22:06,036
