605
00:22:48,107 --> 00:22:49,877
Please, Chef.

606
00:22:49,977 --> 00:22:52,146
She's really getting chewed out.

607
00:22:52,147 --> 00:22:54,716
We can hear the chef yelling all the way over here.

608
00:22:54,717 --> 00:22:57,887
He told us to work hard for the last customers, so I...

609
00:22:58,257 --> 00:23:00,126
- You'd better work hard.
- I mean...

610
00:23:00,127 --> 00:23:01,426
Do you know why?

611
00:23:01,427 --> 00:23:02,907
- They took on the challenge.
- Okay.

612
00:23:03,627 --> 00:23:05,426
Did you warn them that it was incredibly spicy?

613
00:23:05,427 --> 00:23:08,296
It's so spicy that it burns your butt hole.

614
00:23:08,297 --> 00:23:09,736
As the person in charge of the challenge,

615
00:23:09,737 --> 00:23:11,337
- why don't you go over there?
- Okay.

616
00:23:11,497 --> 00:23:13,637
(The challenge authority has arrived.)

617
00:23:14,267 --> 00:23:15,407
Hello again.

618
00:23:15,637 --> 00:23:19,146
The head chef is here to officially announce the challenge.

619
00:23:19,147 --> 00:23:20,246
Hello.

620
00:23:20,247 --> 00:23:21,746
Did you order the challenge?

621
00:23:21,747 --> 00:23:23,016
- How spicy is it?
- You haven't ordered it yet?

622
00:23:23,017 --> 00:23:24,476
- How spicy is it?
- It'll tear your butt hole.

623
00:23:24,477 --> 00:23:26,416
Try not to scare them away.

624
00:23:26,417 --> 00:23:29,186
It's a little spicier than Yeopgi Tteokbokki Original.

625
00:23:29,187 --> 00:23:30,487
Then we can do it.

626
00:23:30,757 --> 00:23:32,526
- But...
- I only eat the spicy type.

627
00:23:32,527 --> 00:23:34,726
It's not just spicy. The portion is huge.

628
00:23:34,727 --> 00:23:36,096
I'm 175cm tall.

629
00:23:36,097 --> 00:23:37,996
- Then I'll only eat what's spicy.
- Can we get a smaller size?

630
00:23:37,997 --> 00:23:39,167
No, you can't.

631
00:23:39,267 --> 00:23:41,166
(One size)

632
00:23:41,167 --> 00:23:44,037
(It's free if you finish it in 20 minutes.)

633
00:23:44,237 --> 00:23:46,136
The three of you can take on the challenge.

634
00:23:46,137 --> 00:23:47,666
- Yes.
- Then we'll take on the challenge.

635
00:23:47,667 --> 00:23:49,176
- You take on the challenge?
- This is amazing.

636
00:23:49,177 --> 00:23:51,177
(It's finally Jade Emperor Tteokbokki.)

637
00:23:51,707 --> 00:23:53,476
(Dead serious)

638
00:23:53,477 --> 00:23:54,946
- Thank you.
- Okay, nice.

639
00:23:54,947 --> 00:23:55,947
