640
00:23:55,948 --> 00:23:57,746
- It’s like they’re challenging me.
- That's right.

641
00:23:57,747 --> 00:24:00,386
I made it as spicy as I can possibly handle.

642
00:24:00,387 --> 00:24:01,447
"Here, try this."

643
00:24:01,757 --> 00:24:03,757
- I'm saying that to everyone.
- I like that idea.

644
00:24:03,987 --> 00:24:05,727
(As a result...)

645
00:24:06,187 --> 00:24:07,686
(After countless rounds of practice, )

646
00:24:07,687 --> 00:24:08,856
