647
00:24:08,857 --> 00:24:10,257
This is ghost pepper tteokbokki.

648
00:24:11,727 --> 00:24:13,266
The length is 175cm.

649
00:24:13,267 --> 00:24:14,496
It's spicy,

650
00:24:14,497 --> 00:24:15,837
and it's impossible to handle.

651
00:24:16,237 --> 00:24:18,466
This is nothing other than Lee Young Ji.

652
00:24:18,467 --> 00:24:20,037
I think of it as myself.

653
00:24:21,137 --> 00:24:23,777
(First, she checks the 175cm-long whole garaetteok.)

654
00:24:23,937 --> 00:24:26,077
I'll give them the prettiest one of the bunch today.

655
00:24:26,347 --> 00:24:27,506
This is the prettiest one.

656
00:24:27,507 --> 00:24:28,917
(It fills the pan.)

657
00:24:29,247 --> 00:24:30,593
It's time to show what you've got.

658
00:24:30,617 --> 00:24:31,947
I'm seriously going to show them.

659
00:24:32,517 --> 00:24:34,147
I won't go easy on them today.

660
00:24:34,287 --> 00:24:35,456
Defeat Lee Young Ji.

661
00:24:35,457 --> 00:24:36,756
Finish the whole thing and it’s free.

662
00:24:36,757 --> 00:24:38,237
Finish the whole thing and it’s free.

663
00:24:38,387 --> 00:24:41,227
I feel alive when I make this.

664
00:24:41,727 --> 00:24:43,627
Making this makes me really happy.

665
00:24:44,427 --> 00:24:46,066
(It's another spicy sauce.)

666
00:24:46,067 --> 00:24:49,567
(Here comes chilli bean sauce.)

667
00:24:49,837 --> 00:24:51,466
This is the last one.

668
00:24:51,467 --> 00:24:52,536
(A generous amount of chilli bean sauce)

669
00:24:52,537 --> 00:24:53,537
I can do this.

670
00:24:53,867 --> 00:24:57,807
(And now, some numbing Sichuan pepper oil)

671
00:24:58,037 --> 00:24:59,407
I'm adding capsaicin too.

672
00:24:59,877 --> 00:25:01,847
One, two.

673
00:25:02,917 --> 00:25:05,287
(And Young Ji gives a mysterious smile.)

674
00:25:05,317 --> 00:25:07,217
One teaspoon of ghost pepper.

675
00:25:07,987 --> 00:25:10,257
Directors, cover your nose.

676
00:25:10,687 --> 00:25:12,686
- Hold your breath.
- Hold your breath.

677
00:25:12,687 --> 00:25:14,567
I walked past it for a second, and... Goodness.

678
00:25:15,197 --> 00:25:16,597
Hold your breath!

679
00:25:19,197 --> 00:25:20,696
There's ghost pepper ahead.

680
00:25:20,697 --> 00:25:23,967
I'm adding 175cm-long rice cakes.

681
00:25:24,497 --> 00:25:26,267
Gosh, the smell is insane.

682
00:25:27,207 --> 00:25:29,777
