684
00:25:34,607 --> 00:25:36,416
Here are your drinks.

685
00:25:36,417 --> 00:25:40,246
If you look closely, there are a lot of cute little details.

686
00:25:40,247 --> 00:25:41,347
We’re the first place...

687
00:25:41,817 --> 00:25:43,917
