695
00:25:57,637 --> 00:26:00,206
- It's especially spicy today?
- Exactly.

696
00:26:00,207 --> 00:26:01,236
(A practice run)

697
00:26:01,237 --> 00:26:03,876
- Your Jade Emperor Tteokbokki...
- Yes.

698
00:26:03,877 --> 00:26:04,936
Challenge is ready.

699
00:26:04,937 --> 00:26:06,176
- Exactly like that.
- It’s so spicy that...

700
00:26:06,177 --> 00:26:08,076
if things go wrong,

701
00:26:08,077 --> 00:26:09,077
you might...

702
00:26:09,078 --> 00:26:11,117
(Let's stop there.)

703
00:26:11,377 --> 00:26:13,687
(Adding sliced beef loin as a topping)

704
00:26:14,417 --> 00:26:15,656
(The beef loin is perfectly cooked.)

705
00:26:15,657 --> 00:26:17,387
One minute before the dish is ready.

706
00:26:18,057 --> 00:26:19,887
(She tastes it for one last time.)

707
00:26:22,157 --> 00:26:23,357
It's extreme today.

708
00:26:26,067 --> 00:26:27,596
Today's first challenge.

709
00:26:27,597 --> 00:26:30,537
(Young Ji's first challenge dish)

710
00:26:30,637 --> 00:26:32,967
(It's finally ready.)

711
00:26:34,037 --> 00:26:35,676
Chef, please serve the challenge dish yourself.

712
00:26:35,677 --> 00:26:36,677
Okay.

713
00:26:36,777 --> 00:26:39,477
(She carries Jade Emperor Tteokbokki with solemn determination.)

714
00:26:39,607 --> 00:26:41,777
The person who made it is here herself.

715
00:26:42,577 --> 00:26:44,076
- Be careful.
- This is unbelievable.

716
00:26:44,077 --> 00:26:45,447
- Be careful, everyone.
- Hello.

717
00:26:45,687 --> 00:26:48,557
This is especially spicy today.

718
00:26:48,817 --> 00:26:50,716
I take no responsibility for anything...

719
00:26:50,717 --> 00:26:51,856
that happens from now on.

720
00:26:51,857 --> 00:26:53,757
(The challenge starts.)

721
00:26:53,927 --> 00:26:55,956
- Twenty minutes?
- I don't think we can finish it.

722
00:26:55,957 --> 00:26:56,996
(The time limit of 20 minutes starts.)

723
00:26:56,997 --> 00:26:57,997
Wait.

724
00:26:57,998 --> 00:26:59,718
