731
00:27:10,207 --> 00:27:12,946
It's okay because the rice cakes are thick.

732
00:27:12,947 --> 00:27:15,447
It's less spicy than I expected.

733
00:27:17,077 --> 00:27:18,177
Young Ji.

734
00:27:18,787 --> 00:27:20,787
