735
00:27:21,887 --> 00:27:24,016
That's the best news I've heard all day.

736
00:27:24,017 --> 00:27:25,157
(She's clearly upset.)

737
00:27:25,257 --> 00:27:27,156
- What about her?
- Tell her to join us.

738
00:27:27,157 --> 00:27:28,756
- Right.
- Hey.

739
00:27:28,757 --> 00:27:30,596
Hurry over. You're a spice addict.

740
00:27:30,597 --> 00:27:32,066
- Is it spicy?
- No, it's not.

741
00:27:32,067 --> 00:27:33,097
It's not spicy at all.

742
00:27:33,697 --> 00:27:34,966
A new side plate.

743
00:27:34,967 --> 00:27:36,566
- Hello.
- Thank you.

744
00:27:36,567 --> 00:27:38,296
You invited someone else. You should've told me.

745
00:27:38,297 --> 00:27:39,607
Thank you so much.

746
00:27:40,007 --> 00:27:41,506
Please relax and enjoy yourselves.

747
00:27:41,507 --> 00:27:43,227
(An unexpectedly fun challenge in progress)

748
00:27:44,777 --> 00:27:47,547
They seemed to be enjoying the challenge very much.

749
00:27:47,607 --> 00:27:48,747
- Is that right?
- Yes.

750
00:27:50,747 --> 00:27:53,317
