756
00:28:05,527 --> 00:28:07,043
That's what makes it a challenge dish.

757
00:28:07,067 --> 00:28:09,197
- You'd better eat more.
- You too.

758
00:28:10,137 --> 00:28:14,207
(They each take a bite happily.)

759
00:28:14,437 --> 00:28:16,807
(Success)

