763
00:28:23,317 --> 00:28:24,716
You're the first ones to clear the challenge.

764
00:28:24,717 --> 00:28:27,047
- Did you really succeed?
- Congratulations.

765
00:28:27,387 --> 00:28:29,587
- Congratulations - Hey, hey.

766
00:28:29,817 --> 00:28:33,626
Congratulations on finishing the whole thing.

767
00:28:33,627 --> 00:28:35,326
(The song is cheerful, but the head chef is burning inside.)

768
00:28:35,327 --> 00:28:36,657
- The five...
- Wasn't it spicy?

769
00:28:36,727 --> 00:28:38,407
- Wasn't it very spicy?
- It wasn't spicy.

770
00:28:38,597 --> 00:28:40,867
- It wasn't spicy? No way.
- It wasn't spicy.

771
00:28:41,167 --> 00:28:42,336
Could you lift up the plate?

772
00:28:42,337 --> 00:28:43,896
- We'll take a photo of you all.
- Really?

773
00:28:43,897 --> 00:28:45,536
- I'll do it with a Polaroid camera.
- Here's the Polaroid camera.

774
00:28:45,537 --> 00:28:47,857
